v 3
d xsamplefe 1.2.3: random samples of panel / fixed-effect data for reghdfe and xhdfe
d
d Draws whole-unit random samples aligned with reghdfe's absorb(), group() and
d individual(); reproduces sample and sample2 for the simple cases; strata,
d balanced panels, mobility structure, connectivity diagnostics, connected sets
d and reconnect. C++/OpenMP plugin without external dependencies.
d Requires Stata 14 or newer and a plugin built for the host platform.
d Distribution-Date: 20260909
d The source checkout provides the build script in stata/tools/.
f xsamplefe.ado
f xsamplefe.sthlp
g LINUX64 xsamplefe_linux64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
g WIN64 xsamplefe_win64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
g MACINTEL64 xsamplefe_macintel64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
g OSX.X8664 xsamplefe_macintel64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
g MACARM64 xsamplefe_macarm64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
g OSX.ARM64 xsamplefe_macarm64.plugin xsamplefe.plugin
h xsamplefe.plugin
F xsamplefe_license.txt
f xsamplefe_basics.do
f xsamplefe_tour.do
f xsamplefe_check.do
